}

body:json {
  {
    "language": "en-US",
    "maturityRating": "TV-MA",
    "isKids": false
  }
}

docs {
  # Update Profile Settings

  Partially updates preference settings (`language`, `maturityRating`, `isKids`) for the authenticated user's profile (`PATCH /api/profile/settings`).
  Requires authentication (`authMiddleware`). At least one valid field must be supplied.

  ## Request Body
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `language` | `string` | No | Preferred UI/metadata language tag (e.g., `"en-US"`, `"es-ES"`). |
  | `maturityRating` | `string` | No | Content maturity threshold (e.g., `"G"`, `"PG-13"`, `"TV-MA"`). |
  | `isKids` | `boolean` | No | Whether the profile is restricted to children's content. |

  ## Responses
  - **200 OK**: Returns the updated profile record.
  - **400 Bad Request**: `{ "error": "No valid fields to update" }`.
  - **401 Unauthorized**: `{ "error": "Unauthorized" }`.
  - **500 Internal Server Error**: `{ "error": "<message>" }`.
}

